    "excerpt": "The BMW-era MINI did not copy the classic Mini; it carried selected codes into a larger, safer and more premium car.",
    "content": "<p>The modern MINI that followed the classic car did not reproduce the 1959 Mini. It could not. Safety, comfort, emissions, crash structure and market expectations had changed completely.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"/assets/images/autoretro/austin/Mini_Clubman_Estate.jpg\" alt=\"Modern-generation Mini Cooper Convertible — contextual illustration\" title=\"Modern Mini Cooper\" width=\"400\" height=\"208\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" /><figcaption>The modern Mini carries familiar names and cues into a car with different dimensions and engineering.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Practical final checks</h2>\n\n<p>The comparison is developed in <a href=\"/en/auto-retro/austin/aventure-mini-austin.php?open_article=mini-classique-ce-qui-est-conserve-perdu#attached-article-mini-classique-ce-qui-est-conserve-perdu\">what was kept or lost</a>. The last classic cars are covered in <a href=\"/en/auto-retro/austin/aventure-mini-austin.php?open_article=dernieres-versions-mini-classique#attached-article-dernieres-versions-mini-classique\">the final classic Mini versions</a>.</p>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.press.bmwgroup.com/global/article/detail/T0300116EN/1959-%E2%80%93-2019-sixty-years-of-mini?language=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BMW Group PressClub, 1959 - 2019. Sixty Years of MINI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.press.bmwgroup.com/ireland/article/detail/T0330396EN/classic-mini-timeline%3A-1959-2000?language=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BMW Group PressClub, Classic Mini Timeline: 1959 - 2000</a></li>\n</ul>",
